    "decision": "Approved the frozen 381-file provenance-observation closure after reading the independent qualification review and runtime continuity addendum. The post-freeze focused run passed 331 tests with six platform-dependent skips. The changes add only the 13 named Libsystem sublibraries from independently selected SDK paths and bind the MSVC /Bv compiler-version row to the actually observed driver. Candidate paths and labels grant no execution authority; existing whole-file, process/image and effective-build checks remain mandatory. Runtime, numerical sources, consumers, schemas, policy and vendor bytes are unchanged. Prior immutable reviews and their explicit test-timing correction remain part of the review chain. This separate source approval does not qualify artifacts: fresh exact-head complete CI and final-byte acceptance remain mandatory.",
